  "description": "OpenID Shared Signals Framework (SSF) 1.0 for .NET: transmitter and receiver in one package. Discover a transmitter, manage event streams and subjects, verify delivery, and send or receive CAEP and RISC events by push or poll.",
  "iconFile": "Abblix.png",
